:00:00.000Z","overview":"Tushar hunts for the mole jeopardising his election campaign. Sanyukta and Jai's investigation points uncomfortably close to the victim's inner circle.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fsjOLCd0VeL1QNKj0gyvZvEGaAH.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9TZWFyY2glMjBUaGUlMjBOYWluYSUyME11cmRlciUyMENhc2UlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"End of the Rope","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sanyukta and Jai realise they've been looking for answers in the wrong places. Meanwhile, the victim's father, consumed by loss, decides to take a drastic step.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dLTguOENQKTkfueUC1BXtcXyhPd.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9TZWFyY2glMjBUaGUlMjBOYWluYSUyME11cmRlciUyMENhc2UlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Devil in the Details","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With every theory falling apart, along with Sanyukta's marriage, she and Jai find themselves at a dead end. But a sudden discovery propels the investigation into a new direction.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oLA1pvS45MdoipGt3DDljCgKCGF.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNS9TZWFyY2glMjBUaGUlMjBOYWluYSUyME11cmRlciUyMENhc2UlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Cat and Mouse","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sanyukta and Jai begin to suspect the killer has been hiding in plain sight all along. But when she uncovers damning new evidence, it forces her to rethink everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dyEZysozxtmoglE2Ltpsd3QN1ZM.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"4.5","cast":["Konkona Sen Sharma","Surya Sharma","Shiv Panditt","Dhruv Sehgal","Shraddha Das","Chaandsi Kataria","Sagar Deshmukh","Iravati Harshe"],"released":"2025-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Konkona Sen S